[TITLE]
API-13: a 3-hour run that halts at 1 hour, when the demand jumps 100,000-fold
With TRIALS 3 and UNBALANCED STOP, hour 0 converges and hour 1 does not.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID  Elev  Demand  Pattern
 J1  0     100     P1
 J2  0     100     P1

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID  Head
 R1  2000

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P2  J1  J2  1000    6     100    0      Open
 P3  R1  J2  2000    8     100    0      Open

[PATTERNS]
;ID  Multipliers
 P1  0.001  100           ; 0.1 gpm at hour 0, 10,000 gpm at hour 1

[TIMES]
 Duration            3:00
 Hydraulic Timestep  1:00
 Pattern Timestep    1:00
 Report Timestep     1:00
 Statistic           Average

[REPORT]
 Summary  No

[OPTIONS]
 Units       GPM
 Headloss    H-W
 Trials      3
 Unbalanced  Stop

[END]
